      "en": "Blessed is the man to whom the LORD doesn’t impute iniquity, in whose spirit there is no deceit.",
      "ko": "마음에 간사가 없고 여호와께 정죄를 당치 않은 자는 복이 있도다",
      "source_text_hash": "1da10767a72495378d86581ce501b712bde98ad434d551d01edc60ed26438c23",
      "translation_text_hash": "84c36c5caf2b7db3a4d0d2901c2cf4df3fa114c108d2f07233037946d97acab3",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
