          "chapter": 32,
          "verse": 4
        }
      ],
      "en": "For day and night your hand was heavy on me. My strength was sapped in the heat of summer. Selah.",
      "ko": "주의 손이 주야로 나를 누르시오니 내 진액이 화하여 여름 가물에 마름 같이 되었나이다(셀라)",
      "source_text_hash": "27995c16d0f0f51da177ed6e1c1cc5b90696e724241d208c8c5e6fce79fbe161",
      "translation_text_hash": "08102a50148ce231b0a7c2b2d243633890b037122da3379a47772c572362c24c",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
