      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "PSA",
          "chapter": 32,
          "verse": 11
        }
      ],
      "en": "Be glad in the LORD, and rejoice, you righteous! Shout for joy, all you who are upright in heart!",
      "ko": "너희 의인들아 여호와를 기뻐하며 즐거워 할찌어다 마음이 정직한 너희들아 다 즐거이 외칠찌어다",
      "source_text_hash": "8058200fc3e6bedddd774511c228b0527f4e2b1f2d63b2f34794b66a9c1ff8fd",
      "translation_text_hash": "89e591412dfc7ae040726ad828a7072f706a8767c524361b76a435642f87ecc8",
